  STA PPUSCROLL                   ;T--- 03E26 FE16: 8D 05 20
  JMP NmiFrameEnd                 ;T--- 03E29 FE19: 4C 7C FE
NmiRender:                        ; OAM DMA, text row, timed scroll split, VRAM queue, game frame
